      "text": "Qualitative selection",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Selection stage",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that contracting authorities are required to consider guidance from the Minister for the Cabinet Office when selecting suppliers for procurement procedures. Qualitative selection refers to the processes through which suppliers are chosen to participate in procurement procedures, as well as determining if they should be excluded from participation. The guidance may relate to the use of questionnaires, and the assessment of information relevant to qualitative assessment.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If a contracting authority deviates from the guidance issued under this regulation, and such deviation is considered to be “reportable” in accordance with the relevant guidance, then it must send a report to the Cabinet Office explaining the deviation.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "When selecting suppliers, contracting authorities must have regard to relevant guidance issued by the Minister for the Cabinet Office. Such guidance may relate to the use of questionnaires, and the assessment of information relevant to qualitative assessment. In certain circumstances, contracting authorities will need to report to the Cabinet Office any deviations from the guidance.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that they have regard to the relevant guidance issued by the Minister for the Cabinet Office when selecting suppliers",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that they adopt, insofar as possible, relevant questionnaires for the purposes of conducting the qualitative assessment",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "consider whether it is necessary to report any deviations from the relevant guidance to the Cabinet Office.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "There is no direct equivalent section in the Procurement Act 2023.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Additional support and guidance",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Make sure you:",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Qualitative selection",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
